  unitName: Zahhak
  unitId: 60062
  unitNumber: 98
  description: A demon with four brain-hungry snakes growing from her shoulders.
    It's said that Zahhak gains the knowledge of the person whose brains she eats,
    so she has a tendency to target intellectuals. They fear Zahhak more than other
    demons, and her name makes them shiver. Some Summoners receive great rewards
    from intellectuals for exterminating Zahhaks.
  summonDesc: Look at that delicious brain.<br>Alright, I'll be your friend!<br>Wait!
    My pets! Hold on!
  fusionDesc: These four are so happy.<br>They're slithering all over.
  evoDesc: Let us continue our journey!<br>Oh, and my pets are <br>coming too!
  element: 6
  rarity: 2
